    <!-- ===== CID03 tool-screen ramp =====
         The design ships these screens on a green ramp (its g-050 … g-900 CSS
         variables). This app is Indigo, so each step is rebuilt at the SAME
         lightness on
         the brand hue — the design's contrast relationships survive, the screens
         read as this app. `cid_600` is @color/primary and `cid_700` is
         @color/on_primary_container; they are spelled out rather than aliased so
         the ramp reads as one ordered scale.

         The clay / teal / amber accents are NOT rotated: the design uses them as
         distinct per-tool signal colours, and turning them violet too would
         collapse the whole palette into one hue. Dark values in values-night. -->
    <color name="cid_900">#2B1354</color>
    <color name="cid_050">#F8F5FF</color>

